City Palace, Jantar Mantar and Hawa Mahal are close together, so they fit in one morning. Amber Fort and Nahargarh are better as a separate trip.

India's real GDP growth fell to about -5.8% in FY 2020-21 and has settled near 6.5% in FY 2024-25. These figures are from memory and rounded, so check the latest release from the government's statistics office before relying on them.

